    "body": "Closes #3.\n\nFixes the inaccuracies the issue called out (and the additional drift the reporter suspected might exist), then documents every previously-undocumented function on the `Mdk` API.\n\n## API corrections\n\n- `mdk.acceptWelcome(welcomeJson = welcome.eventJson)` → `mdk.acceptWelcome(welcome)` (same for `declineWelcome`).\n- `MessageProcessingResult` → `ProcessMessageResult`; the `when` block now reflects the real variants (`ApplicationMessage`, `Proposal`, `PendingProposal`, `ExternalJoinProposal`, `Commit`, `Unprocessable`, `IgnoredProposal`, `PreviouslyFailed`).\n- Removed the `processMessages` (plural) section — that function does not exist.\n- `updateGroupMetadata(...)` → `updateGroupData(mlsGroupId, GroupDataUpdate(...))`.\n- `newMdk(dbPath)` → `newMdk(dbPath, serviceId, dbKeyId, config)` in all three example sites.\n- `createMessage(...)` examples now pass the required `tags`/`eventTags` parameters (both `null` by default).\n- `getMessage(eventId)` → `getMessage(mlsGroupId, eventId)`.\n- `getMessages(mlsGroupId)` and `getPendingWelcomes()` updated to show the required `limit` / `offset` / `sortOrder` parameters.\n- `MdkUniffiError` → `MdkUniffiException` (subclasses: `Storage`, `Mdk`, `InvalidInput`).\n- `KeyPackageResult.keyPackage` is **Base64**, not hex; documented `tags` (kind `30443`) vs `tagsLegacy` (kind `443`), plus the previously-undocumented `hashRef` and `dTag` fields.\n- Data classes corrected: `ByteArray?` instead of `List<UByte>?` for image fields on `Group` / `Welcome`; added the previously-missing `Message.createdAt`, `Group.lastMessageProcessedAt`, and `Group.selfUpdateState`.\n\n## Newly documented functions\n\nThe previous README covered a small slice of the public API. The new sections cover every public symbol on the `Mdk` interface and every top-level helper in `src/main/kotlin/build/marmot/mdk/mdk_uniffi.kt`:\n\n- **Key packages:** `deleteKeyPackageFromStorage`, `deleteKeyPackageFromStorageByHashRef`; rotation note for `createKeyPackageForEventWithOptions`.\n- **Group queries:** `getRelays`.\n- **Group lifecycle:** `leaveGroup`, `selfDemote`, `selfUpdate`, `groupsNeedingSelfUpdate`, `deleteGroup`, `syncGroupMetadataFromMls`, `clearPendingCommit`, `mergePendingCommit`.\n- **Welcomes:** `processWelcome`, `getWelcome`, `acceptWelcomeJson`, `declineWelcomeJson`.\n- **Messages:** `getLastMessage`, `deleteMessagesForGroup`, `processMessageWithContext`.\n- **Encrypted media (messages):** `encryptMediaForUpload`(`WithOptions`), `createMediaImetaTag`, `parseMediaImetaTag`, `decryptMediaFromDownload`.\n- **Group images:** `prepareGroupImageForUpload`(`WithOptions`), `decryptGroupImage`, `deriveUploadKeypair`.\n- **Diagnostics:** `groupCapabilityUpgradeStatus`, `upgradeGroupCapabilities`, `groupRequiredProposals`, `groupMemberCapabilities`, `ownLeafIndex`, `groupLeafMap`, `getRatchetTreeInfo`, `pendingAddedMembersPubkeys`, `pendingRemovedMembersPubkeys`, `pendingMemberChanges`.\n- **Setup:** `initKeyringStore`, `newMdkWithKey`.\n\n**Coverage:** 50/50 interface methods and 7/7 top-level helpers are now referenced by name in the README.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Every claim cross-checked against the generated bindings in `src/main/kotlin/build/marmot/mdk/mdk_uniffi.kt`.\n- Prose scanned for AI writing patterns with `shaka scan` — **100/100 PASS**, 0 violations.\n\nDiff: +446 / −79 lines on `Readme.md`.\n\n@SubatomicPlanets — flagging since you filed the issue. The reporter also noted that \"some of these might also be the case in the MDK bindings for other languages.\" That's a fair guess — the same UniFFI source generates the Swift/Python bindings, so the equivalent READMEs likely need the same audit.\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-begin -->\n\n---\n\n<a href=\"https://stagereview.app/marmot-protocol/mdk-kotlin/pull/6\">\n  <picture>\n    <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-dark.svg\">\n    <img src=\"https://stagereview.app/assets/gh-open-in-stage-light.svg\" alt=\"Open in Stage\">\n  </picture>\n</a>\n\n<!-- stage-review-badge-end -->\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Enhanced MDK Kotlin initialization guidance and keyring priming instructions\n  * Expanded key-package docs covering fields, publish/parse flows, rotation, and deletion from storage\n  * Extended group docs: relays, data updates, lifecycle ops, welcome handling, and sync/merge behaviors\n  * Updated message docs: creation (new optional tags), paginated/sortable retrieval, single-message access, deletion counts, and incoming-processing result variants\n  * Revised data type descriptions and Android integration examples to match updated APIs\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_start -->\n\n[![Review Change Stack](https://storage.googleapis.com/coderabbit_public_assets/review-stack-in-coderabbit-ui.svg)](https://app.coderabbit.ai/change-stack/marmot-protocol/mdk-kotlin/pull/6?utm_source=github_walkthrough&utm_medium=github&utm_campaign=change_stack)\n\n<!-- review_stack_entry_end -->\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
