    "body": "![marmot](https://blossom.primal.net/4e8e1b86aa3e9c4dc52b11b63e4fa1b9e8054e83cbfce294a696332c1db66f49.png)\n\nThe marmot colony's documentation artists have been busy — each major section of the README now has its own SNES-style 16-bit pixel art marmot illustration, from Installation all the way through the Complete Workflow example. The burrow has never looked so good.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added visual badges throughout the README for enhanced readability and organization.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
